  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1901.04 Incorporated Definitions. All terms used in these rules relative to procedures, applications, inspections, or fees that are defined in Plc 100 through Plc 400 or Plc 1000 shall have the meaning specified in title Plc.\n\nSource. #14429, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36",
